}

DreamListStyle:bOverride_RowSpacing {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamListStyle:bOverride_RowSpacing
    src   "Between rows. Zero is the dense list UMG draws by default."
    text  "行与行之间。为零时即为UMG默认绘制的紧凑列表。"
    state machine
}

DreamListStyle:bOverride_StateFaces {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamListStyle:bOverride_StateFaces
    src   "A different drawing per row STATE, where RowBrush is one drawing the row colours tint five\nways. Empty throughout, which is what keeps every existing list pixel-identical; RowBrush is\nwhat an unstated state falls back to.\n\nThe rows share one group rather than carrying one each, for the reason every other number in\nthis struct is shared: a list's rows are the same row drawn many times, and a row that could\nbe skinned individually would be a template, not a style.\n\nThe foreground tint and the pressed padding in the group are not read here -- a row's label\ncolour is TextColor above, and a row has no content padding of its own to alternate."
    text  "每个行状态各有一份不同的绘制，其中 RowBrush（笔刷）是一份由行颜色按五种\n方式着色的绘制。全部为空，这正是让每个现有列表保持像素一致的原因；RowBrush 是\n未声明状态的回落对象。\n\n各行共用一个组，而不是各自携带一个，这与该结构体中其他每个数字\n都是共享的原因相同：列表的各行是同一行绘制多次，而一个可以\n单独换肤的行会是模板，而不是样式。\n\n组中的前景着色与按下时的填充在这里不会被读取——行的标签\n颜色是上方的 TextColor，而行没有自己的内容填充可供交替。"
    state machine
}

DreamListStyle:bOverride_TransitionDuration {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamListStyle:bOverride_TransitionDuration
    src   "How long a row's state change takes, in seconds. Zero snaps."
    text  "行的状态变化所需的时间，单位为秒。为零时瞬间切换。"
    state machine
}

DreamListStyle:RowHeight {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamListStyle:RowHeight
    src   "A row's extent along the scroll axis (a tile's height in a tile view). At least one unit: a row no\ntaller than nothing is drawn by nothing, and the window arithmetic falls back to a fixed sixteen\nlines for a value under that which an old asset or SetStyle can still hand it."
    text  "行沿滚动轴方向的尺寸（在平铺视图中即图块的高度）。至少为一个单位：高度\n为零的行不会被绘制，而对于低于该值的数值（旧资源或 SetStyle 仍可能传入），\n窗口计算会回退到固定的十六行。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchorStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamMenuAnchorStyle
    src   "A menu anchor: the popup's look, and how it is placed against whatever opened it.\n\nWhere UMG's MenuAnchor keeps Placement as a widget property, it lives here because it is the same\nkind of decision as a corner radius -- a project wants every menu to open the same way -- and\nbecause the control still exposes it per instance through the style's override bits.\n\nThe placement ENUM is not declared here: it is EDreamMenuPlacement, which belongs to\nUDreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor along with the arithmetic that reads it. One enum and one set of\nplacement maths for the layout panel and the control, so a menu opened by either lands in the same\nplace -- and so there is nothing to keep in step when a placement is added."
    text  "菜单锚点：弹出窗口的外观，以及它相对于打开它的对象如何放置。\n\nUMG 的 MenuAnchor 把 Placement 作为控件属性保存，而这里把它放在样式中，因为它与圆角半径\n属于同一类决定——项目希望每个菜单都以相同方式打开——而且\n控件仍可通过样式的覆盖位按实例暴露它。\n\n放置方式的枚举不在此处声明：它是 EDreamMenuPlacement，属于\nUDreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor，读取它的计算也一并属于那里。布局面板与控件共用同一个枚举和\n同一套放置计算，因此由二者之一打开的菜单都会落在同一\n位置——新增一种放置方式时也没有需要同步的地方。"
    state machine
}

DreamMenuAnchorStyle:bOverride_Background {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamMenuAnchorStyle:bOverride_Background
    src   "The menu's own face, behind whatever the menu class draws. Transparent leaves it to the menu."
