DreamProgressBarStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamProgressBarStyle
    src   "A progress bar: a track and the filled part of it.\n\nNo handle colours and no pointer states, because there is no behaviour: what fraction is filled\nis the control's one property, and the fill's geometry is the control's own to drive."
    text  "进度条：一条轨道及其填充部分。\n\n没有手柄颜色，也没有指针状态，因为没有行为：填充比例\n是控件唯一的属性，填充的几何形状由控件自己驱动。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_BorderPadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_BorderPadding
    src   "Between the track's edge and the fill -- UMG's BorderPadding.\n\nSpent on the FILL, not on the track: the track still reaches both ends of what the bar spans,\nso the bar looks the same size and the fill sits inside it. Along the bar's axis the padding\nshortens the travel and moves the starting edge in; across it, the fill is thinner and stays\ncentred between the two sides (an uneven pair shifts it, as it should).\n\nZero is what this bar has always drawn, and stays the default for that reason. The Radial\nshape ignores it: a ring's fill sits exactly ON its track, and insetting it would make a\nsecond, smaller ring rather than a padded one."
    text  "轨道边缘与填充之间——即UMG的BorderPadding。\n\n作用于填充而非轨道：轨道仍会延伸到进度条所跨的两端，\n因此进度条看起来大小不变，而填充位于其内部。沿进度条轴向，填充会\n缩短行程并把起始边缘内移；横向则使填充变窄并保持在两侧之间居中\n（两侧数值不等时会产生偏移，这符合预期）。\n\n此进度条一直绘制为零，因此零仍是默认值。Radial\n形状会忽略它：环形的填充恰好落在其轨道之上，内缩只会得到\n第二个更小的环，而不是带填充的环。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_CornerRadius {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_CornerRadius
    src   "Half the default height: a capsule, the silhouette UMG's bar fakes with a rounded brush."
    text  "默认高度的一半：胶囊形，即UMG进度条用圆角笔刷模拟出的轮廓。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_Height {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_Height
    src   "The control's own height; length comes from wherever it is placed, like the slider's."
    text  "控件自身的高度；长度取决于它的放置位置，与滑块相同。"
    state machine
}

DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_RadialSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_RadialSize
    src   "Radial only: the ring's outer size. The bar shape takes its length from wherever it is placed."
    text  "仅径向：环形外部的尺寸。条形形态的长度取决于它的放置位置。"
    state machine
