DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_RadialStartAngle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_RadialStartAngle
    src   "Radial only: where zero percent sits, in degrees clockwise from twelve o'clock."
    text  "仅径向：零百分比所在的位置，以从十二点方向顺时针计的度数表示。"
