DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_RadialThickness {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamProgressBarStyle:bOverride_RadialThickness
    src   "Radial only: how thick the ring is, as a fraction of half its size. 1 is a full pie."
    text  "仅径向：环的厚度，为其尺寸一半的比例。1 表示完整的饼形。"
