}

DreamRadioButtonStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRadioButtonStyle
    src   "A radio button: the toggle's anatomy -- a box, a mark inside it, a label beside it -- with the\nmark an image dot rather than a glyph, and the corner radius defaulted to HALF the box so the\nface reads as a radio with nobody styling anything.\n\nThe box and the dot carry separate colour sets for the same reason the toggle's box and tick do:\nthe pointer transition and the checked transition are two writers, and pointed at one visual they\noverwrite each other."
    text  "单选按钮：沿用开关的结构——一个方框、框内的标记、旁边的标签——其中\n标记是图像圆点而不是字形，圆角半径默认为方框的一半，因此\n在无人定制样式时外观也读作单选按钮。\n\n方框和圆点各自带有独立的颜色集，原因与开关的方框和勾选标记相同：\n指针过渡和选中过渡是两个写入者，若指向同一个视觉元素，它们\n会互相覆盖。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButtonStyle:bOverride_BoxDisabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRadioButtonStyle:bOverride_BoxDisabled
    src   "Not interactable. Every control pushed three pointer colours and left this one to the\nbehaviour's library default, a flat grey that belongs to no theme -- so a disabled control was\nthe one state a project sheet could not describe."
    text  "不可交互。每个控件都推送了三种指针颜色，却把这一种留给\n行为库的默认值——一种不属于任何主题的纯灰色——所以禁用状态的控件\n曾是项目样式表唯一无法描述的状态。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButtonStyle:bOverride_BoxFocused {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRadioButtonStyle:bOverride_BoxFocused
    src   "Focused by keyboard or gamepad, which is a different question from hovered: focus survives the\npointer moving away, and on a pad there is no pointer at all. Pushing a colour here is what\nturns the selectable's focus visuals on -- they ship off, so before this a pad user saw the\nnavigation land on nothing."
    text  "由键盘或手柄获得焦点，这与悬停是两回事：指针移开后\n焦点依然存在，而在手柄上根本没有指针。在这里推送颜色，才会\n开启可选择控件的焦点视觉效果——它们默认是关闭的，所以在此之前手柄用户看到的\n导航会落在空处。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButtonStyle:bOverride_CornerRadius {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRadioButtonStyle:bOverride_CornerRadius
    src   "Half of BoxSize by default -- that is the whole of what makes a radio round. Kept a knob\nrather than derived, so a project that squares its radios is one edit, not a subclass."
    text  "默认为BoxSize的一半——这正是让单选按钮呈圆形的全部。保留为可调参数\n而非派生值，因此想把单选按钮改成方形的项目只需改一处，而无需子类化。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButtonStyle:bOverride_DotUnchecked {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRadioButtonStyle:bOverride_DotUnchecked
    src   "Transparent, not absent: the dot exists either way, unchecked just does not show it."
    text  "透明而非不存在：无论哪种状态圆点都存在，未选中时只是不显示它。"
    state machine
}

DreamRadioButtonStyle:bOverride_TransitionDuration {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRadioButtonStyle:bOverride_TransitionDuration
    src   "How long a state change takes, in seconds. Zero snaps."
    text  "状态变化所需的时间，单位为秒。零表示瞬间切换。"
    state machine
}

DreamRichTextStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRichTextStyle
    src   "A rich text block: one paragraph that reads markup.\n\nOnly the text's own look, because that is all a rich text block is -- no face, no padding, no\nstates. What makes it RICH is the two data assets the markup resolves against, and those are the\ncontrol's properties rather than the style's: they are content (which tag means which sprite),\nnot theme."
    text  "富文本块：解析标记的一个段落。\n\n仅包含文本自身的外观，因为富文本块本就仅此而已——没有字体、没有填充、没有\n状态。让它成为“富”文本的是标记所解析的两个数据资产，而它们是\n控件的属性而不是样式的属性：它们属于内容（哪个标签对应哪个精灵），\n而不是主题。"
    state machine
}

DreamRichTextStyle:bOverride_Font {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRichTextStyle:bOverride_Font
    src   "The DEFAULT typeface, as a font data asset -- markup may still switch it per run. Null leaves\nthe paragraph on the font it has, which is what every existing block uses."
    text  "默认字体，以字体数据资产形式指定——标记仍可在运行时切换它。为空时\n段落保持其现有字体，这也是所有现有块的用法。"
    state machine
}

DreamRichTextStyle:bOverride_OverrideMaterial {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRichTextStyle:bOverride_OverrideMaterial
    src   "A material to draw the glyphs with instead of the built-in one -- UMG's default font material.\nNull keeps the library's own text material, which is what every existing block uses."
    text  "用于绘制字形的材质，代替内置材质——即UMG的默认字体材质。\n为空时保留库自身的文本材质，这也是所有现有块的用法。"
    state machine
}

DreamRichTextStyle:bOverride_TextStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRichTextStyle:bOverride_TextStyle
    src   "Outline, drop shadow and glow -- what UMG spells as the shadow half of an FTextBlockStyle, and\nwhat this library has always drawn from FDreamTextStyle's underlay.\n\nHere rather than on the control because it is theme: a project decides that its prose carries a\nshadow, not each paragraph. Default-constructed means every effect switched off (each one's\ncolour ships with alpha zero), which is what a rich text block looked like before this existed."
    text  "描边、投影和发光——即UMG中FTextBlockStyle的阴影部分，也是\n本库一直从FDreamTextStyle的底层绘制的部分。\n\n放在这里而不是控件上，因为它属于主题：由项目决定其正文是否带\n阴影，而不是每个段落。默认构造表示所有效果均关闭（每个效果的\n颜色自带零alpha），这也是此功能出现之前富文本块的样子。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle
    src   "A ring menu: wedges around a hub, and the geometry that decides where they sit.\n\nBigger than the other style structs in this file, and it has to be: a ring menu has no natural\nsize the way a button has a height. Where the ring begins and ends, how far round it runs, how\nwide the gaps are and where the labels ride are all APPEARANCE -- a project themes its wheels\nonce, and a designer who wants a half-ring on the left edge of the screen gets there without a\nsubclass. What the menu CONTAINS, and how it answers a pointer, stays on the control.\n\nEvery radius is in local units, measured from the ring's centre."
    text  "环形菜单：围绕中心枢纽的扇形，以及决定它们位置的几何参数。\n\n比本文件中的其他样式结构体更大，而且必须如此：环形菜单不像按钮有高度那样有天然的\n尺寸。环从哪里开始到哪里结束、绕行多少度、\n间隙多宽以及标签位于何处，全都属于外观——项目只为其转盘设定一次\n主题，而想让半环出现在屏幕左边缘的设计师无需子类\n即可实现。菜单包含什么内容、如何响应指针，则留在控件上。\n\n所有半径均以本地单位表示，从环的中心量起。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_BackdropColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_BackdropColor
    src   "The unbroken ring behind the wedges, filling the gaps between them. Transparent to switch it\noff; it is a separate node and costs nothing when it draws nothing."
    text  "扇形块后方连续不断的圆环，填充它们之间的空隙。将其设为透明即可\n关闭；它是一个独立节点，不绘制任何内容时没有开销。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_ContentRadius {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_ContentRadius
    src   "Where an item's icon and label ride, as a radius. Zero means midway between the two edges,\nwhich is right for almost every ring and stays right when the radii change."
    text  "项图标与标签所处位置的半径。零表示位于两条边缘的正中间，\n这对几乎所有的圆环都合适，并且在半径变化时依然合适。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_ContentWidth {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_ContentWidth
    src   "How wide an item's icon-and-label box is, which is also what a long label wraps at."
    text  "项图标与标签盒的宽度，长标签也按此宽度换行。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_HighlightGrowth {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_HighlightGrowth
    src   "How much further out the highlighted wedge reaches. Zero for a wheel that only recolours."
    text  "高亮扇形块向外多伸出的距离。零表示只做变色处理的轮盘。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_HubColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_HubColor
    src   "The disc inside InnerRadius. Transparent leaves the middle of the screen visible."
    text  "InnerRadius 内部的圆盘。透明时屏幕中央保持可见。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_HubTextColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_HubTextColor
    src   "The hub's caption -- the highlighted item's name, in the common arrangement."
    text  "轮毂的标题文字——在常见布局中即高亮项的名称。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_IconSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_IconSize
    src   "An item's icon, when it has one. A brush stating its own ImageSize wins over this."
    text  "项的图标（如果有）。若画笔自带 ImageSize，则以画笔为准。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_IconSpacing {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_IconSpacing
    src   "Between the icon and the label under it."
    text  "图标与其下方标签之间的间距。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_InnerRadius {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_InnerRadius
    src   "The hole. Also the hub's radius, and (unless DeadZoneRadius overrides it) the radius inside\nwhich the pointer picks nothing -- one number for one edge, because three knobs describing\nthe same circle is three chances for it to stop being a circle."
    text  "中间的孔洞。同时也是轮毂的半径，并且（除非 DeadZoneRadius 覆盖）是指针\n不选中任何内容的半径——一条边缘只用一个数值，因为用三个旋钮描述同一个\n圆，就有三次让它不再是圆的机会。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_ItemGapAngle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_ItemGapAngle
    src   "Taken out of each wedge, half at each end, so neighbours do not touch.\n\nDrawn only. The HIT sector keeps the full slice, which is not a shortcut: with the gap in the\nhit shape too, dragging across one would exit a wedge and enter nothing, and the highlight\nwould blink off between every pair of items."
    text  "从每个扇形中扣除，两端各占一半，使相邻项互不接触。\n\n仅用于绘制。命中扇区仍保留完整切片，这不是偷懒：如果命中形状也留出\n空隙，拖过空隙就会离开一个扇形却进入不了任何项，高亮也会\n在每两项之间闪烁消失。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_LabelHeight {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_LabelHeight
    src   "The box a label is drawn in, which decides where the icon above it ends up.\n\nZero derives it as 2.6 line heights, so a label that wraps to two lines still sits centred\nwhere a one-line label sat -- the text is vertically centred in this box, and measuring the\nreal thing is not available where this is decided (a rebuild runs with no layout pass behind\nit, and a headless test has no text layout at all)."
    text  "绘制标签所用的盒，它决定其上方图标最终的位置。\n\n零表示按2.6倍行高推导，这样换成两行的标签仍居中原先单行标签所在的位置——\n文本在此盒中垂直居中，而在做出这一决定的地方无法测量真实尺寸\n（重建运行时其后没有布局过程，无头测试中更是完全没有\n文本布局）。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_OpenDuration {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_OpenDuration
    src   "How long Open and Close take. Zero snaps -- and so does a control with no world, because the\ntween manager is a world subsystem and hands back null without one (which is every headless\ntest, and is why the end state is written first and the tween only animates toward it)."
    text  "Open 与 Close 的时长。零表示立即切换——没有 world 的控件也是如此，因为补间\n管理器是 world 子系统，没有 world 时返回空（所有无头测试都是这种情况，这也是\n为什么先写入结束状态，补间只负责朝它动画）。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_OpenScaleFrom {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_OpenScaleFrom
    src   "What the ring scales up FROM while opening, and back down to while closing."
    text  "打开时环形菜单从该比例放大，关闭时又缩回该比例。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_OuterRadius {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_OuterRadius
    src   "The wedges' far edge. The control sizes itself to twice this, square."
    text  "扇区的外缘。控件将自身尺寸设为该值的两倍，呈正方形。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_StartAngle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_StartAngle
    src   "Where the first item begins, in degrees clockwise from twelve o'clock."
    text  "第一个项的起始位置，用从十二点方向顺时针计算的角度表示。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_SweepAngle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_SweepAngle
    src   "How far round the items are spread from there. 360 is a full wheel; 180 is the half-ring a\nmenu hanging off a screen edge wants, and it is why this is a knob at all."
    text  "各项从该位置起展开的角度范围。360为整圆；180是挂在屏幕边缘的菜单\n所需的半环，这也是需要此参数的原因。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_TransitionDuration {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_TransitionDuration
    src   "How long a wedge's state change takes, in seconds. Zero snaps."
    text  "扇区状态变化所用的时间，单位为秒。为零时立即切换。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_WedgeDisabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_WedgeDisabled
    src   "An item whose bEnabled is false. Its selectable is switched off, so the pointer transition\nnever reaches it and this is the only colour it ever wears."
    text  "bEnabled为false的项。其可选择控件已关闭，因此指针过渡\n永远不会作用到它，这是它唯一会显示的颜色。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_WedgeFocused {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_WedgeFocused
    src   "Focused by keyboard or gamepad. A ring is the one control in the library a pad reaches FIRST,\nand pushing a colour here is what turns the selectable's focus visuals on -- they ship off, so\nstepping round the wheel with the stick used to move a highlight nothing drew."
    text  "由键盘或游戏手柄聚焦。环形菜单是本库中手柄最先触及的控件，\n在此处推送颜色才能开启可选择控件的聚焦视觉效果——这些效果默认关闭，因此\n以往用摇杆在轮盘上移动时，移动的是一个无人绘制的高亮。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_WedgeSelected {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamRingMenuStyle:bOverride_WedgeSelected
    src   "The committed item's wedge. Separate from Hovered because the two say different things."
    text  "已确认项的扇区。与悬停状态分开，因为两者表达的含义不同。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBarStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamScrollBarStyle
    src   "A scroll box: a clipped viewport, the content that slides inside it, and the bars beside it.\n\nThe bar's own look is FDreamScrollBarStyle -- the same struct the standalone scroll bar uses, so\na project styles its bars once and both wear it."
    text  "滚动框：一个裁剪的视口、在其中滑动的内容，以及旁边的滚动条。\n\n滚动条自身的外观是 FDreamScrollBarStyle——与独立滚动条使用相同的结构体，因此\n项目只需为滚动条设置一次样式，两者都会沿用。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_BarPadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_BarPadding
    src   "The margin around the WHOLE bar -- UMG's ScrollbarPadding, and a different measurement from\nHandlePadding above, which insets the handle inside its track.\n\nSpent on the bar's rect rather than on the track's, so the track still reaches both ends of\nwhat the bar spans and the handle never travels past it. A scroll box counts this into its\ngutter, because the gutter is everything the viewport gives up for the bar to sit there.\nZero is what every bar in this library has drawn, and stays the default for that reason."
    text  "整个滚动条四周的外边距——即 UMG 的 ScrollbarPadding（滚动条填充），与上面的\nHandlePadding（手柄填充）是两种不同的度量，后者是把柄在轨道内缩进的距离。\n\n该边距作用于滚动条的矩形，而不是轨道的矩形，因此轨道仍能到达滚动条所跨越的两端，\n手柄也永远不会越过它。滚动框会把它计入自身的间隙，因为间隙就是视口为容纳\n滚动条而让出的全部空间。\n本库中所有滚动条绘制的都是零，因此它仍是默认值。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_CornerRadius {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_CornerRadius
    src   "Half the thickness is a capsule, which is what a bar reads as with nobody styling it."
    text  "取厚度的一半即为胶囊形，这也是无人设置样式时滚动条呈现的样子。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_HandleDisabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_HandleDisabled
    src   "Not interactable. Every control pushed three pointer colours and left this one to the\nbehaviour's library default, a flat grey that belongs to no theme -- so a disabled control was\nthe one state a project sheet could not describe."
    text  "不可交互。每个控件都推送了三种指针颜色，却把这一种留给\n行为库的默认值——一种不属于任何主题的纯灰色——所以禁用状态的控件\n曾是项目样式表唯一无法描述的状态。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_HandleFocused {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_HandleFocused
    src   "Focused by keyboard or gamepad, which is a different question from hovered: focus survives the\npointer moving away, and on a pad there is no pointer at all. Pushing a colour here is what\nturns the selectable's focus visuals on -- they ship off, so before this a pad user saw the\nnavigation land on nothing."
    text  "由键盘或手柄获得焦点，这与悬停是两回事：指针移开后\n焦点依然存在，而在手柄上根本没有指针。在这里推送颜色，才会\n开启可选择控件的焦点视觉效果——它们默认是关闭的，所以在此之前手柄用户看到的\n导航会落在空处。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_HandleNormal {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_HandleNormal
    src   "The handle carries the pointer transition, the way the slider's does."
    text  "手柄承载指针过渡，与滑块的手柄相同。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_HandlePadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_HandlePadding
    src   "How far the HANDLE is inset from the track, across the bar's axis -- Slate's\nFScrollBarStyle::Thickness beside its track, and the reason a real scroll bar reads as a pill\nrunning down a groove rather than as one solid slab. Zero (the default) is the handle filling\nthe track, which is what this bar has always drawn."
    text  "手柄从轨道内缩的距离，沿滚动条的轴线方向测量——相当于 Slate 的\nFScrollBarStyle::Thickness 与轨道的间距，这也是真实滚动条看起来像沿凹槽滑动的\n胶囊、而不是一整块实心板的原因。零（默认值）表示手柄填满\n轨道，本滚动条一直是这样绘制的。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBarStyle:bOverride_Thickness {
