DreamTextInputStyle:bOverride_CaretColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamTextInputStyle:bOverride_CaretColor
    src   "The caret, and the highlight behind a selection. The one pair of colours a text field cannot\ndo without and the only ones this sheet did not describe: the behaviour's own defaults were\nleft to drive them, and its caret default sat four values away from Background above -- an\ninvisible caret on the library's own theme. They follow the text, as a caret does."
    text  "光标，以及选区背后的高亮。这是文本字段不可或缺的一对颜色，\n也是此样式表唯一没有描述的部分：此前交由行为自身的默认值\n驱动，而它的光标默认值与上方的背景相差四个色值——在库自身的主题上\n就是一个看不见的光标。它们跟随文本，正如光标那样。"
    state machine
}

