DreamThrobberStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamThrobberStyle
    src   "A throbber: N identical pieces, animating, saying only \"something is happening\".\n\nOne control and one style for UMG's two, the call this library already made for the progress bar's\nBar and Radial and the slider's Direction: the pieces, the period and the colours are identical,\nand the only thing that differs is where the pieces are put. The palette still offers two rows."
    text  "旋转指示器：N 个相同的块在运动，只表示“有事情正在发生”。\n\nUMG 的两个控件合为一个控件、一份样式，这是本库为进度条的\nBar 与 Radial、滑块的 Direction 已经做过的取舍：块、周期和颜色都相同，\n唯一的区别是块被摆放的位置。调色板仍提供两行。"
    state machine
}

DreamThrobberStyle:bOverride_CornerRadius {
