DreamTileViewStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamTileViewStyle
    src   "A tile view: a list whose rows are a grid of tiles.\n\nBuilt the way FDreamTreeViewStyle is -- carrying a whole FDreamListStyle rather than restating its\nfields -- because a tile view IS a list that wraps, and a project that styles its lists styles the\ntiles' faces, hover and selection with them. What it adds is the one thing a row does not have: a\nWIDTH of its own, because a tile is not as wide as the view.\n\nFDreamListStyle::RowHeight stays the tile's height, so there is exactly one place a tile's size is\nwritten down; TileWidth is its partner and lives here."
    text  "平铺视图：一种列表，其每一行都是平铺块的网格。\n\n按 FDreamTreeViewStyle 的方式构建——携带整个 FDreamListStyle，而不是重复其\n字段——因为平铺视图本身就是会换行的列表，为列表设置样式的项目也会用它们来设置\n平铺块的外观、悬停和选中状态。它额外增加的，正是行所没有的那样东西：\n自己的宽度，因为平铺块并不与视图等宽。\n\nFDreamListStyle::RowHeight 仍然是平铺块的高度，因此平铺块的尺寸只在一处\n写明；TileWidth 是它的搭档，就放在这里。"
    state machine
}

DreamTileViewStyle:bOverride_List {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamTileViewStyle:bOverride_List
    src   "The tiles and the viewport, shared whole with the list. RowHeight is the tile's height."
    text  "图块与视口，与列表整体共用。RowHeight 为图块的高度。"
    state machine
}

DreamTileViewStyle:bOverride_TileSpacing {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamTileViewStyle:bOverride_TileSpacing
    src   "Between tiles across a row. Down the column the gap is FDreamListStyle::RowSpacing."
    text  "同一行内各图块之间的间距。列方向的间距由 FDreamListStyle::RowSpacing 决定。"
    state machine
}

DreamTileViewStyle:bOverride_TileWidth {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamTileViewStyle:bOverride_TileWidth
    src   "A tile's width. Its height is FDreamListStyle::RowHeight -- one tile, one size, two fields."
    text  "图块的宽度。其高度由 FDreamListStyle::RowHeight 决定——一个图块，一种尺寸，两个字段。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggleStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamToggleStyle
    src   "What a toggle looks like, separated from what it is.\n\nThis is the FButtonStyle shape, and it exists for the reason Slate's does: the control assembles\nitself, so every appearance decision has to be a knob or it is a fork. The box and the tick have\nseparate colour sets because they carry separate transitions -- the pointer one tints the box,\nthe checked one tints the tick, and one visual cannot hold both."
    text  "开关的外观，与其本身分离。\n\n这就是 FButtonStyle 的结构，它存在的原因与 Slate 相同：控件会自行\n组装，因此每个外观决策都必须做成可调项，否则就只能分叉。方框与勾选标记拥有\n各自的颜色集，因为它们承载不同的过渡——指针过渡为方框着色，\n选中过渡为勾选标记着色，同一份视觉无法同时容纳两者。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_BoxBrush {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_BoxBrush
    src   "The background. State colours (BoxNormal/Hovered/Pressed) tint it, exactly as with no image."
    text  "背景。状态颜色（BoxNormal/Hovered/Pressed）会为其着色，与没有图像时完全一致。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_BoxDisabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_BoxDisabled
    src   "Not interactable. Every control pushed three pointer colours and left this one to the\nbehaviour's library default, a flat grey that belongs to no theme -- so a disabled control was\nthe one state a project sheet could not describe."
    text  "不可交互。每个控件都推送了三种指针颜色，却把这一种留给\n行为库的默认值——一种不属于任何主题的纯灰色——所以禁用状态的控件\n曾是项目样式表唯一无法描述的状态。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_BoxFocused {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_BoxFocused
    src   "Focused by keyboard or gamepad, which is a different question from hovered: focus survives the\npointer moving away, and on a pad there is no pointer at all. Pushing a colour here is what\nturns the selectable's focus visuals on -- they ship off, so before this a pad user saw the\nnavigation land on nothing."
    text  "由键盘或手柄获得焦点，这与悬停是两回事：指针移开后\n焦点依然存在，而在手柄上根本没有指针。在这里推送颜色，才会\n开启可选择控件的焦点视觉效果——它们默认是关闭的，所以在此之前手柄用户看到的\n导航会落在空处。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_CheckedBrush {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_CheckedBrush
    src   "The mark, per state, as images -- UMG's CheckedImage / UncheckedImage / UndeterminedImage.\nA state whose brush holds an image draws it (sized by the brush's ImageSize, else TickSize);\na state whose brush is empty keeps the built-in glyph -- check mark, nothing, em-dash."
    text  "勾选标记，按状态以图像表示——即 UMG 的 CheckedImage / UncheckedImage / UndeterminedImage。\n笔刷中带有图像的状态会绘制该图像（尺寸由笔刷的 ImageSize 决定，否则使用 TickSize）；\n笔刷为空的状态则保留内置字形——对勾、空白、破折号。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_CornerRadius {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_CornerRadius
    src   "Of the box. The faces are procedural rects now, which is where the UMG feel mostly lives."
    text  "方框的。现在各个面都是程序化矩形，UMG 的观感主要就来自这里。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_StateFaces {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_StateFaces
    src   "The BOX's drawing per pointer state, where BoxBrush is one drawing tinted five ways. Nothing to\ndo with the mark: the three brushes above answer \"which of the three values is this\", this one\nanswers \"is the pointer on it\", and a check box shows both at once."
    text  "方框按指针状态绘制的图形，而 BoxBrush 是同一图形以五种方式着色。与勾选标记无\n关：上面三个笔刷回答“这是三个值中的哪一个”，这一个\n回答“指针是否在其上”，复选框会同时展示两者。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_TickUnchecked {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_TickUnchecked
    src   "Transparent, not absent: the tick exists either way, unchecked just does not show it."
    text  "透明而非不存在：无论是否选中，勾选标记都存在，只是未选中时不显示。"
    state machine
}

DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_TransitionDuration {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamToggleStyle:bOverride_TransitionDuration
    src   "How long a state change takes, in seconds. Zero snaps."
    text  "状态变化所需的时间，单位为秒。零表示瞬间切换。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeViewStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamTreeViewStyle
    src   "A tree: a list whose rows carry an indent and a twisty."
    text  "树：一种列表，其行带有缩进和展开箭头。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeViewStyle:bOverride_ExpandedBrush {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamTreeViewStyle:bOverride_ExpandedBrush
    src   "Empty keeps the built-in glyphs, the way the check box's state brushes do."
    text  "为空时保留内置字形，与复选框的状态笔刷相同。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeViewStyle:bOverride_IndentPerLevel {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamTreeViewStyle:bOverride_IndentPerLevel
    src   "Per depth level."
    text  "按深度层级。"
    state machine
}

DreamTreeViewStyle:bOverride_List {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamTreeViewStyle:bOverride_List
    src   "The rows and the viewport, shared whole with the list -- a tree IS a list that indents."
    text  "行与视口，与列表整体共享——树就是一个带缩进的列表。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFaceBrush {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIFaceBrush
    src   "An optional skin for a control part's procedural-rect face.\n\nEmpty means the face stays the plain rounded rect -- the built-in look. Set a texture (or an\natlas sprite) and the face draws it inside the same silhouette: corner radius, borders and the\nselectable's tint all keep working, because the skin is the rect's BODY texture, not a different\nvisual. Deliberately not the image brush: a control face never stops being a rect."
    text  "控件部件程序化矩形面的可选皮肤。\n\n留空表示该面保持普通的圆角矩形——即内置外观。设置纹理（或\n图集精灵）后，该面会在同一轮廓内绘制它：圆角半径、边框和\n可选择项的着色都照常生效，因为皮肤是矩形的 BODY 纹理，而不是另一种\n视觉表现。刻意不采用图像画刷：控件面永远不会不再是矩形。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFaceBrush:DrawMode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIFaceBrush:DrawMode
    src   "Image / Box / Border -- Slate's DrawAs, and the last thing this brush could not say.\n\nBox and Border are nine-slice: Margin's edges keep their own pixel size and only the middle\nstretches, so a skin drawn with a bevel or a stitched border survives being put on a button of\na different size. Border is Box without its middle, for a frame around something else.\n\nOnly for a plain TEXTURE. An atlas sprite's UV span is a sub-rect of its atlas, so slicing\nwithin it would read the neighbouring sprite; a sprite draws as Image whatever this says."
    text  "Image / Box / Border——Slate 的 DrawAs，也是此画刷一直无法表达的最后一项。\n\nBox 和 Border 是九宫格切片：Margin 的边缘保持自身的像素尺寸，只有中间\n拉伸，因此用斜角或缝合边框绘制的皮肤，放到不同尺寸的按钮上\n依然完好。Border 是没有中间的 Box，用于在别的内容外围加框。\n\n仅适用于普通 TEXTURE。图集精灵的 UV 范围是其图集的子矩形，在其中切片\n会读到相邻的精灵；无论此项怎么设置，精灵都按 Image 绘制。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFaceBrush:Image {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIFaceBrush:Image
    src   "One slot for the image, the Slate-brush shape: a plain texture or an atlas sprite, whichever\nis dropped in. Two typed slots with a \"sprite wins\" rule was a worse panel for the same data."
    text  "图像只有一个槽位，即 Slate 画刷的形态：普通纹理或图集精灵，拖入\n哪个就是哪个。两个带类型的槽位加“精灵优先”规则，对同样的数据来说是更糟的面板。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFaceBrush:ImageSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIFaceBrush:ImageSize
    src   "The image's own drawn size -- Slate's ImageSize. Zero means no opinion: the part keeps the\nsize its style gives it. Non-zero wins over the style's size field on the parts that carry\none (the toggle's box and mark, the radio's box and dot, the slider's handle)."
    text  "图像自身的绘制尺寸——Slate 的 ImageSize。零表示不作主张：部件保持\n其样式给定的尺寸。非零时，在带有尺寸字段的部件上会覆盖样式的\n尺寸字段（开关的框和标记、单选按钮的框和圆点、滑块的把手）。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFaceBrush:Margin {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIFaceBrush:Margin
    src   "The nine-slice edges, in TEXTURE pixels -- Slate's Margin, and the number the artist has: a\nborder eight pixels wide in the file stays eight pixels wide on screen at any rect size.\nIgnored unless DrawMode slices."
    text  "九宫格切片边缘，以 TEXTURE 像素为单位——Slate 的 Margin，也是美术手头\n的数字：文件中八像素宽的边框，在任何矩形尺寸的屏幕上仍是八像素宽。\n除非 DrawMode 进行切片，否则忽略。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFaceBrush:ScaleMode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIFaceBrush:ScaleMode
    src   "Stretch / FitIn / Envelop -- the rect's three, matching UMG's Stretch / ScaleToFit / ScaleToFill."
    text  "Stretch / FitIn / Envelop——矩形的三种方式，对应 UMG 的 Stretch / ScaleToFit / ScaleToFill。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFaceBrush:Tint {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIFaceBrush:Tint
    src   "Multiplied over the image -- Slate's tint. A separate channel from the style's state colours:\nthose ride the visual's colour via the selectable's transition, this rides the rect's BODY\ncolour, and the two multiply."
    text  "叠加乘到图像上——Slate 的着色。它与样式的状态颜色是相互独立的通道：\n后者通过可选择项的过渡作用于视觉表现的颜色，而此项作用于矩形的 BODY\n颜色，两者相乘。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIStateFaces {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIStateFaces
    src   "One face drawn five ways -- Slate's FButtonStyle shape, which is the thing a control style here\ncould not say.\n\nA control face is a procedural rect with ONE skin on it, and the five states were told apart by\ncolour alone: a project whose normal and pressed buttons are different DRAWINGS had to fork the\ncontrol. That is the gap this closes, and it closes it without a second state machine -- the\nselectable already decides which of the five a control is in, and this is only what that decision\npaints (see UDreamUIControl::UseStateFaces).\n\nEVERY FIELD IS OPTIONAL, and that is what makes it change nothing that already exists. A state\nwhose brush holds no image falls back to Normal's, and a Normal holding none falls back to the\ncontrol's own single brush -- so a style that says nothing here draws exactly what it drew before,\ndown to the pixel. The same is true of the other three groups: the foreground tint is gated on a\nbit that ships off, the pressed padding on another, and the three sounds are null.\n\nShared rather than per-control because a project's buttons, check boxes, dropdown faces and list\nrows are the same decision made once. It is a FIELD of each of those styles rather than a base\nstruct: a USTRUCT hierarchy would not survive the override-bit merge, which reads one struct's\nproperties and writes the ticked ones onto another of the same type."
    text  "一个面，五种画法——Slate 的 FButtonStyle 形态，正是这里的控件样式\n无法表达的东西。\n\n控件面是一个只带一张皮肤的程序化矩形，五个状态仅靠\n颜色区分：普通按钮和按下按钮是不同绘制的项目，不得不为\n控件分叉。这就是此项填补的空白，而且它无需第二套状态机——\n可选择项已经决定了控件处于五种状态中的哪一种，而这里只决定该决定\n绘制什么（见 UDreamUIControl::UseStateFaces）。\n\n每个字段都是可选的，正因如此它不会改变任何已有内容。某个状态\n的画刷不含图像时回退到 Normal 的，Normal 也不含时回退到\n控件自身的那张单一画刷——因此在这里什么都不设置的样式，绘制结果与之前完全一致，\n精确到像素。其他三组也是如此：前景着色由一个默认关闭的\n位控制，按下填充由另一个位控制，三个声音为空。\n\n之所以共享而非逐控件设置，是因为项目的按钮、复选框、下拉面板和列表\n行都是同一个决定只做一次。它是各个样式的一个字段，而不是基\n结构体：USTRUCT 继承层次无法经受覆盖位合并，该合并读取一个结构体的\n属性，并把勾选的属性写到另一个同类型的结构体上。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIStateFaces:bTintForeground {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIStateFaces:bTintForeground
    src   "Whether the five colours below are pushed at all.\n\nOff, and nothing is written to the foreground part -- which is the only default that leaves an\nexisting control looking as it does, because \"no opinion\" has no spelling in an FColor: white\nis a real instruction to tint white, and a label authored amber would lose its colour to it."
    text  "是否推送下面的五种颜色。\n\n关闭时，不会向前景部件写入任何内容——这是唯一能让\n现有控件保持原样的默认值，因为“不作主张”在 FColor 中无从表达：白色\n就是一条真实的着白指令，而一个设为琥珀色的标签会因此失去自己的颜色。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIStateFaces:bUsePressedPadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIStateFaces:bUsePressedPadding
    src   "Whether PressedPadding is used at all. Off, a pressed control keeps its resting padding."
    text  "是否使用 PressedPadding。关闭时，按下的控件保持静止时的填充。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIStateFaces:Focused {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIStateFaces:Focused
    src   "Holding keyboard or gamepad focus, which is a different question from hovered -- focus survives\nthe pointer leaving, and on a pad there is no pointer at all."
    text  "持有键盘或游戏手柄焦点，这与悬停是不同的问题——焦点在指针\n离开后仍然保留，而在手柄上根本不存在指针。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIStateFaces:Hovered {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIStateFaces:Hovered
    src   "Pointer resting on it. Empty falls back to Normal."
    text  "指针停在其上时的外观。留空则回退到 Normal。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIStateFaces:HoveredSound {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIStateFaces:HoveredSound
    src   "The three moments a control makes a noise, as a STYLE decision: a click should sound like the\nother clicks in this UI, which is the same argument the colours make.\n\nPushed onto the selectable, which is what owns the playing (it knows the state it just entered\nand the widget to play from). A UDreamSelectableStyle asset on that selectable still wins,\nexactly as it does for the colours. Navigation gets no slot of its own -- a move fires Enter on\nthe target, so HoveredSound already plays once per move."
    text  "控件发出声音的三个时机，作为一项样式决策：一次点击的声音应当与\n这个 UI 中其他点击一致，这与颜色所持的理由相同。\n\n压在可选择控件上，由它负责播放（它知道自己刚进入的状态，\n以及从哪个控件播放）。该可选择控件上的 UDreamSelectableStyle 资产仍然优先，\n与颜色的处理完全一致。导航没有自己的槽位——一次移动会在\n目标上触发 Enter，因此 HoveredSound 每次移动已经播放一次。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIStateFaces:Normal {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIStateFaces:Normal
    src   "The resting skin. Empty means the control's own brush, which is what every style ships with."
    text  "静止状态的外观。留空表示使用控件自身的画笔，这是每个样式自带的默认值。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIStateFaces:NormalForeground {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIStateFaces:NormalForeground
    src   "What the control's FOREGROUND part -- its own label or glyph, never a host's content -- is\ntinted in each state. Slate's ForegroundColor, per state as FButtonStyle has it.\n\nOnly controls that own a label nominate one (the dropdown's caption is the family's example);\non a control whose text belongs to whoever filled its hole there is nothing here to write to,\nand reaching into a host's widgets to recolour them would be this control overruling the author."
    text  "控件的前景部分——它自己的标签或字形，绝不是宿主的内容——在每个状态下的着色。\n即 Slate 的 ForegroundColor，按状态设置，与 FButtonStyle 的做法一致。\n\n只有拥有标签的控件才会指定它（下拉框的标题就是该家族的示例）；\n对于文本属于填充其空位者的控件，这里没有可写入的内容，\n而深入宿主的控件去重新着色，等于让此控件推翻作者的决定。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIStateFaces:PressedPadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#DreamUIStateFaces:PressedPadding
    src   "What surrounds the content WHILE PRESSED -- Slate's PressedPadding, and the classic way a\nbutton looks pushed in: a top-heavy margin nudges the label down a pixel. The resting number is\nthe control's own ContentPadding rather than a second copy here; see UDreamButton."
    text  "按下时内容周围的填充——即 Slate 的 PressedPadding，也是按钮看起来被按下的经典做法：\n上重下轻的边距把标签向下推一个像素。静止时的数值是\n控件自身的 ContentPadding，而不是在这里再存一份；参见 UDreamButton。"
    state machine
}

EDreamProgressShape {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#EDreamProgressShape
    src   "Which silhouette a progress bar draws.\n\nOne control, two shapes, for the reason the slider has one Direction rather than two Blueprint\npresets: the parts, the events and the percent are identical, and the only thing that differs is\nhow the fill is drawn. Radial rides the rect's own RadialFill -- no second visual, no mask."
    text  "进度条绘制哪种轮廓。\n\n一个控件，两种形状，理由与滑块只有一个 Direction 而不是两个蓝图\n预设相同：部件、事件和百分比都完全一致，唯一的差别只在于\n填充的绘制方式。Radial 使用矩形自身的 RadialFill——没有第二个视觉元素，也没有遮罩。"
    state machine
}

EDreamProgressShape.Bar {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#EDreamProgressShape:Bar
    src   "A horizontal bar; Percent is the fill's width."
    text  "水平条；百分比表示填充的宽度。"
    state machine
}

EDreamProgressShape.Radial {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#EDreamProgressShape:Radial
    src   "A ring; Percent is the swept angle."
    text  "环形；百分比表示扫过的角度。"
    state machine
}

EDreamThrobberShape {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#EDreamThrobberShape
    src   "Which silhouette a throbber draws. The progress bar's Bar/Radial split, for the same reason."
    text  "进度指示器的形状。进度条的条形/环形选择，原因相同。"
    state machine
}

EDreamThrobberShape.Circular {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#EDreamThrobberShape:Circular
    src   "Pieces around a circle, UMG's CircularThrobber."
    text  "圆形图案，UMG 的 CircularThrobber。"
    state machine
}

EDreamThrobberShape.Linear {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#EDreamThrobberShape:Linear
    src   "A row of pieces, UMG's Throbber."
    text  "一排图案，UMG 的 Throbber。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUIStyleSource {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamControlStyles.h#EDreamUIStyleSource
    src   "Where a native control's look comes from.\n\nThe default is the project sheet, because that is the point of having one: a code-built control\nhas no tree for anyone to open and recolour, so without a project-wide answer every instance is a\nhand-tuned fork. Inline is the opt-out for the one toggle on one screen that really is special.\n\nThis used to say that Inline was a deliberate opt-out and NOT a merge -- that a style is one\ndecision, and \"sheet for most fields, instance for two\" is how two sources of truth learn to\ndisagree. The middle ground is now a third answer rather than an accident, and the argument has\nan answer: a merge is only ambiguous while nobody can see which side won. Every field carries a\ntick beside it, the panel greys what is not in effect, and ProjectStyleSheetOverride is a state\nan author chose rather than a state a struct drifted into. What made the old objection right was\nthat one toggle wanting a red face had to fork nine fields it did not care about, and forks are\nthe thing a sheet exists to prevent."
    text  "原生控件的外观来自何处。\n\n默认是项目样式表，因为拥有样式表的意义正在于此：由代码构建的控件\n没有可供人打开并重新着色的树，因此若无项目范围的答案，每个实例都会成为\n手工调整的分支。Inline 是针对某个屏幕上确实特殊的那一个开关的退出选项。\n\n这里以前写的是：Inline 是有意的退出，而非合并——样式是一个决定，\n而“大多数字段用样式表、两个字段用实例”正是两个事实来源学会\n彼此矛盾的方式。如今这个折中方案是第三种答案，而不是意外，并且这个论点有了\n答案：只有当没人能看出哪一方获胜时，合并才是含糊的。每个字段旁边都有\n一个勾选标记，面板会把未生效的部分置灰，而 ProjectStyleSheetOverride 这一重载是\n作者选定的状态，而不是结构体漂移进入的状态。旧反对意见之所以成立，\n是因为一个想要红色外观的开关不得不为九个它并不关心的字段创建分支，而分支正是\n样式表存在所要防止的东西。"
    state machine
}

